          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 20:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ogambire Abaisraeli oti: Buzimazima mutaribura kurinda sabato zangye; ahabw'okuba niko kamanyiso ahagati yangye naimwe omu busingye bwanyu bwona, mubone kumanya ku niinye MUKAMA orikubeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 20:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo muryaguma murinde sabato; ahabw'okuba n'erikwera ahariimwe; omuntu weena origishiisha, aryaitwa; omuntu weena origikoreraho omurimo gwona, acuubwe omu ihanga rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro mukaaga emirimo ebe nimwo yaakorerwa; kwonka ekiro kya mushanju niyo sabato ey'okuruhuukiriraho kimwe, eyereziibwe MUKAMA. Orikora omurimo gwona aha izooba rya sabato, buzimazima aitwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo Abaisraeli baryarinda sabato, bagume nibahitsya emigyenzo yaayo omu busingye bwabo bwona, ebe endagaano etarihwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako n'akamanyiso ahagati yangye n'Abaisraeli akarigumaho ebiro byona; ahabw'okuba omu biro mukaaga nimwo MUKAMA yaahangiire eiguru n'ensi, akahuumura aha kiro kya mushanju, akaruhuuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
