              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 3:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA ku yaaherize kugambira na Musa aha rushozi Sinai, yaamuha ebishate by'amabaare bibiri ebiriho Ebirikuhamya, ebihandiikirwe orukumu rwa Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
